    routePath: 'bestia',
    LLM: 'Game: Bestia. Type: Rams/Gambling. Rules: Must follow, must trump. Evaluation: High Trump = Auto-Play. Low Hand = Fold. Pot Odds calculation required.',
    Player: 'The pot is 50 chips. You have the King of Trumps and a 7 of a side suit. Do you play? If you win 1 trick, you get 16 chips. If you win 0, you pay 50. With the King, one trick is guaranteed unless... someone voids and trumps you? No, King is high. PLAY!',
    tagline: 'Win a trick or pay the price.',
